---
import { blogPosts, type BlogPostSummary } from "@/data/blog-posts";

interface Props {
  post: BlogPostSummary;
}

const { post } = Astro.props;
const relatedPosts = blogPosts.slice(-3);

const socialLinks = [
  {
    label: "Facebook",
    href: "https://facebook.com",
    icon: "/images/faq/facebook.svg",
  },
  { label: "X", href: "https://x.com", icon: "/images/faq/x.svg" },
  {
    label: "Instagram",
    href: "https://instagram.com",
    icon: "/images/faq/instagram.svg",
  },
  {
    label: "LinkedIn",
    href: "https://linkedin.com",
    icon: "/images/blog/linkedin.svg",
  },
  {
    label: "Threads",
    href: "https://threads.com",
    icon: "/images/faq/threads.svg",
  },
];
---

<article class="blog-detail">
  <header class="article-hero">
    <img src={post.image} alt="" fetchpriority="high" />
    <div class="article-hero__shade"></div>
    <h1 data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="900">{post.title}</h1>
  </header>

  <div class="article-container">
    <div class="article-meta" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="900">
      <div class="article-meta__date">
        <span>Publish Date</span>
        <time datetime={post.dateTime}>{post.date}</time>
      </div>
      <div class="article-meta__social">
        <span>Social Handle</span>
        <div>
          {
            socialLinks.map((social) => (
              <a
                href={social.href}
                target="_blank"
                rel="noreferrer"
                aria-label={social.label}
              >
                <img src={social.icon} alt="" width="20" height="21" />
              </a>
            ))
          }
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="article-content">
      <h2 class="article-lead" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="900">
        Unique. Original. Remarkable. It’s difficult to develop real estate
        marketing <br class="article-lead__break" />ideas day in and day out
        that meet each of these criteria — especially
        <br class="article-lead__break" />when you spend much of your time on
        the road meeting with clients and
        <br class="article-lead__break" />leads.
      </h2>

      <section aria-labelledby="time-management-title">
        <h3 id="time-management-title">The Importance of Time Management:</h3>
        <p>
          The success of your real estate business depends on how well your
          online marketing funnel attracts new home buyers. 44% of all home
          buyers and 99% of Millennials go to the Internet first when finding
          properties for sale. As a real estate professional, you need a
          professional website if you expect to increase revenue over time.
        </p>
        <p>
          Home buyers expect quality as they search for homes and the REALTOR®
          that best fits their needs. Your website should showcase your property
          listings, brand and expertise. Tools that help you stand out include:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>Branded messaging and images</li>
          <li>Responsive design</li>
          <li>IDX integration</li>
          <li>Blog content</li>
          <li>Lead capture landing pages</li>
          <li>Area pages</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <img
        class="article-image"
        src="/images/blog/article-moving-family.png"
        alt="Family moving into a new home"
        width="1280"
        height="731"
        loading="lazy"
        data-aos="fade-up"
        data-aos-duration="900"
      />

      <section aria-labelledby="practical-tips-title">
        <h3 id="practical-tips-title">
          Practical Tips for Improving Time Management:
        </h3>
        <ol>
          <li>
            If you’ve ever checked out BuzzFeed before, then you know people
            like to take quizzes on just about any subject. Test your audience
            with a short, multiple-choice quiz on something of interest. See if
            they know things like which famous people grew up in the area and
            tidbits about your town’s history. The questions or topics can even
            be created around broader subjects unrelated to your market, like
            music, movies, or some other facet of pop culture.
          </li>
          <li>
            Creating a website provides a digital hub for interested buyers to
            learn more about available properties. They’ll also be able to learn
            about your real estate agency or agent who is representing them.
          </li>
          <li>
            Pro tip: Whether you work at a brokerage or have your own firm,
            creating a website is a great way to grow your personal brand, show
            positive reviews from clients you’ve helped, and continue bringing
            in more qualified leads.
          </li>
          <li>
            A blog allows you to demonstrate industry expertise, establishing
            credibility with potential clients. Blogs also create an outlet for
            sharing industry news, events, and advice for potential clients. You
            can stay top of mind for your audience, so they think of you when
            it's time to buy.
          </li>
        </ol>
      </section>

      <section aria-labelledby="email-campaign-title">
        <h3 id="email-campaign-title">Develop email marketing campaigns.</h3>
        <ol>
          <li>
            Send a monthly newsletter roundup of your blog content, and reach
            out to contacts when new property listings are available. Include
            images of the properties that link to the full listing, a video
            walkthrough of the property, or a virtual staging of the home.
          </li>
          <li>
            Creating email marketing campaigns lets you connect with past and
            potential clients in real estate marketing. By keeping in touch,
            agents can stay top of mind with their audience, increasing the
            chances of receiving referrals or securing repeat business.
          </li>
          <li>
            Virtual buyers can envision themselves in a potential new home
            before visiting the property. By presenting a virtual representation
            of a furnished property, they can better understand how to use the
            space and what it would look like if they lived there.
          </li>
        </ol>
      </section>

      <img
        class="article-image"
        src="/images/blog/article-home-research.png"
        alt="Couple researching their new home"
        width="1280"
        height="731"
        loading="lazy"
        data-aos="fade-up"
        data-aos-duration="900"
      />

      <div class="article-callouts">
        <p>
          Paid Instagram promotions allow agents to target their ideal audience
          with precision. Instagram ads can target specific demographics,
          ensuring the most relevant audience sees the ad.
        </p>
        <p>
          Pro tip: Video ads on Instagram or TikTok aren’t just great for
          promoting listings — they also give you a chance to show your
          personality and build credibility with potential clients.
        </p>
      </div>

      <section class="article-conclusion" aria-labelledby="conclusion-title">
        <h3 id="conclusion-title">Conclusion</h3>
        <p>
          Make yourself and your knowledge available to the community by hosting
          mini-seminars. Consider providing a basic 101 seminar about the basics
          of home buying and mortgages.
        </p>
        <p>
          Remember, marketing today is all about inbound, and that doesn’t just
          apply online. Users want you to share some of your knowledge for free
          before investing time and money in you. A home buying seminar is the
          local equivalent of a webinar. Yes, it will take time and energy, but
          attendees will walk away impressed and will have established a
          relationship with you. That relationship will be worth its weight in
          gold when they’re ready to shop for a home.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="similar-posts" aria-labelledby="similar-posts-title">
    <div class="similar-posts__inner">
      <div class="similar-posts__header">
        <h2 id="similar-posts-title">Similar Blog &amp; Insights</h2>
        <a href="/blog">Read all stories <span aria-hidden="true">›</span></a>
      </div>
      <div class="similar-posts__grid">
        {
          relatedPosts.map((related, index) => (
            <a
              class="related-card"
              href={`/blog/${related.slug}`}
              data-aos="fade-up"
              data-aos-delay={String(index * 80)}
              data-aos-duration="900"
            >
              <div class="related-card__image">
                <img
                  src={related.image}
                  alt=""
                  width="848"
                  height="440"
                  loading="lazy"
                />
              </div>
              <div class="related-card__content">
                <h3>{related.title}</h3>
                <div>
                  <time>{related.date}</time>
                  <p>by {related.author}</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </a>
          ))
        }
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="blog-detail-cta" aria-labelledby="blog-detail-cta-title">
    <img
      src="/images/company/cta.avif"
      alt="Modern property at dusk"
      loading="lazy"
    />
    <div class="blog-detail-cta__shade"></div>
    <div
      class="blog-detail-cta__content"
      data-aos="fade-up"
      data-aos-duration="1000"
    >
      <h2 id="blog-detail-cta-title">
        <span>Ready to Make a</span>
        <span>Move? Contact Us Now!</span>
      </h2>
      <p>
        Contact us today to discuss your property needs and choose the right
        plan. We’re here to guide you through every step of the process.
      </p>
      <a href="/contact">Get Your Home</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</article>

<style>
  .blog-detail {
    --hq-green: #1f4938;
    --hq-lime: #dbfb1e;
    --hq-warm: #f7f6f4;
    color: #0a0915;
    background: #fff;
  }

  .blog-detail h1,
  .blog-detail h2,
  .blog-detail h3,
  .blog-detail p,
  .blog-detail ul,
  .blog-detail ol {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .article-hero {
    position: relative;
    height: 565px;
    overflow: hidden;
    color: #fff;
  }

  .article-hero > img,
  .article-hero__shade {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .article-hero > img {
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center;
  }

  .article-hero__shade {
    background: rgba(10, 9, 21, 0.32);
  }

  .article-hero h1 {
    position: absolute;
    top: 221px;
    right: 30px;
    left: 30px;
    max-width: 1000.14px;
    margin-inline: auto;
    font-family: var(--font-secondary), "Geist", sans-serif;
    font-size: 80px;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 92px;
    letter-spacing: -3.5px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .article-container {
    width: min(1000.14px, calc(100% - 60px));
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .article-content {
    width: 100%;
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .article-meta {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-top: 70px;
  }

  .article-meta__date,
  .article-meta__social {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .article-meta__date {
    gap: 18px;
  }

  .article-meta__date > span,
  .article-meta__social > span {
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 28.8px;
    letter-spacing: -0.4px;
  }

  .article-meta__date time {
    padding: 10px 16px;
    border-radius: 32px;
    background: var(--hq-warm);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 28.8px;
    letter-spacing: -0.4px;
  }

  .article-meta__social {
    gap: 32px;
  }

  .article-meta__social > div {
    display: flex;
    gap: 20px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .article-meta__social a {
    display: grid;
    width: 20px;
    height: 21px;
    place-items: center;
    transition: transform 180ms ease;
  }

  .article-meta__social a:hover,
  .article-meta__social a:focus-visible {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .article-meta__social img {
    width: 20px;
    height: 21px;
  }

  .article-content {
    padding: 82px 0 110px;
  }

  .article-lead {
    font-family: var(--font-secondary), "Geist", sans-serif;
    font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 44.8px;
    letter-spacing: -1.5px;
  }

  .article-content section {
    margin-top: 36px;
  }

  .article-content h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-secondary), "Geist", sans-serif;
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 33.6px;
    letter-spacing: -1px;
  }

  .article-content section > p,
  .article-content li {
    color: #52525a;
    font-size: 20px;
    line-height: 36px;
    letter-spacing: -0.5px;
  }

  .article-content section > p,
  .article-content section > ol,
  .article-content section > ul {
    margin-top: 36px;
  }

  .article-content section > p + p {
    margin-top: 36px;
  }

  .article-content ul,
  .article-content ol {
    padding-left: 32px;
  }

  .article-content li {
    padding-left: 8px;
  }

  .article-image {
    display: block;
    width: 990px;
    max-width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    aspect-ratio: 1280 / 731;
    margin: 36px 0 0;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: 16px;
  }

  .article-callouts {
    display: grid;
    gap: 36px;
    margin-top: 36px;
  }

  .article-callouts p {
    font-family: var(--font-secondary), "Geist", sans-serif;
    font-size: 32px;
    line-height: 44.8px;
    letter-spacing: -1.5px;
  }

  .article-conclusion {
    margin-top: 36px !important;
  }

  .similar-posts {
    min-height: 801px;
    padding: 130px 30px 120px;
    border-radius: 24px 24px 0 0;
    background: var(--hq-warm);
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .similar-posts__inner {
    width: min(1168.641px, 100%);
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .similar-posts__header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  .similar-posts__header h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-secondary), "Geist", sans-serif;
    font-size: 48px;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 60px;
    letter-spacing: -2.5px;
  }

  .similar-posts__header > a {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 18px;
    color: var(--hq-green);
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 28.8px;
  }

  .similar-posts__header > a span {
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 300;
  }

  .similar-posts__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 24px;
    margin-top: 64px;
  }

  .related-card {
    min-width: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: 16px;
    color: #0a0915;
    background: #fff;
    transition:
      transform 300ms cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1),
      box-shadow 300ms ease;
  }

  .related-card__image {
    aspect-ratio: 848 / 440;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .related-card__image img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    transition: transform 550ms cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);
  }

  .related-card__content {
    padding: 24px 16px 16px;
  }

  .related-card h3 {
    min-height: 67.2px;
    font-family: var(--font-secondary), "Geist", sans-serif;
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 33.6px;
    letter-spacing: -1px;
  }

  .related-card__content > div {
    min-height: 82.406px;
    margin-top: 10px;
    padding: 16px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: var(--hq-warm);
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .related-card time,
  .related-card__content p {
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 25.2px;
    letter-spacing: -0.2px;
  }

  .related-card time {
    color: var(--hq-green);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .related-card__content p {
    color: #52525a;
  }

  .related-card:hover,
  .related-card:focus-visible {
    box-shadow: 0 18px 44px rgba(15, 44, 32, 0.12);
    transform: translateY(-4px);
  }

  .related-card:hover .related-card__image img,
  .related-card:focus-visible .related-card__image img {
    transform: scale(1.045);
  }

  .blog-detail-cta {
    position: relative;
    height: 624.609px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: 24px 24px 0 0;
    color: #fff;
  }

  .blog-detail-cta > img,
  .blog-detail-cta__shade {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .blog-detail-cta > img {
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center;
  }

  .blog-detail-cta__shade {
    background: linear-gradient(
      180deg,
      rgba(24, 55, 75, 0.46),
      rgba(9, 25, 33, 0.02)
    );
  }

  .blog-detail-cta__content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    width: min(748px, calc(100% - 40px));
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding-top: 88px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .blog-detail-cta h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-secondary), "Geist", sans-serif;
    font-size: 48px;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 60px;
    letter-spacing: -2.5px;
  }

  .blog-detail-cta h2 span {
    display: block;
  }

  .blog-detail-cta__content > p {
    max-width: 598px;
    margin: 16px auto 32px;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 32.4px;
    letter-spacing: -0.2px;
  }

  .blog-detail-cta__content > a {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 10px 24px;
    border-radius: 32px;
    color: #050505;
    background: var(--hq-lime);
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 28.8px;
    transition:
      transform 180ms ease,
      filter 180ms ease;
  }

  .blog-detail-cta__content > a:hover,
  .blog-detail-cta__content > a:focus-visible {
    filter: brightness(0.95);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .article-hero {
      height: 328px;
    }

    .article-hero h1 {
      top: 100px;
      right: 20px;
      left: 20px;
      font-size: 40px;
      line-height: 46px;
      letter-spacing: -1px;
    }

    .article-container {
      width: calc(100% - 40px);
    }

    .article-content {
      width: 100%;
    }

    .article-meta {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-top: 60px;
    }

    .article-meta__date,
    .article-meta__social {
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .article-meta__date {
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .article-meta__date time {
      padding: 6px 12px;
    }

    .article-meta__social {
      gap: 24px;
      min-height: 37px;
    }

    .article-meta__social > div {
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .article-content {
      padding: 30px 0 100px;
    }

    .article-lead,
    .article-callouts p {
      font-size: 32px;
      line-height: 44.8px;
      letter-spacing: -1.5px;
    }

    .article-lead__break {
      display: none;
    }

    .article-callouts p:first-child {
      min-height: 403.172px;
    }

    .article-content section {
      margin-top: 36px;
    }

    .article-content section > p,
    .article-content li {
      font-size: 20px;
      line-height: 36px;
    }

    .article-content section > p,
    .article-content section > ol,
    .article-content section > ul {
      margin-top: 36px;
    }

    .article-content ul,
    .article-content ol {
      padding-left: 30px;
    }

    .article-image {
      width: 100%;
      margin-top: 36px;
      border-radius: 16px;
    }

    .similar-posts {
      min-height: 0;
      padding: 70px 20px 80px;
      border-radius: 16px 16px 0 0;
    }

    .similar-posts__header {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .similar-posts__header h2 {
      width: 100%;
      font-size: 36px;
      line-height: 45px;
      letter-spacing: -1.8px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .similar-posts__header > a {
      flex: 0 0 auto;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .similar-posts__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 24px;
      margin-top: 50px;
    }

    .related-card h3 {
      min-height: 0;
    }

    .blog-detail-cta {
      height: 506.422px;
      border-radius: 16px 16px 0 0;
    }

    .blog-detail-cta__content {
      width: calc(100% - 40px);
      padding-top: 60px;
    }

    .blog-detail-cta h2 {
      font-size: 36px;
      line-height: 45px;
      letter-spacing: -1.8px;
    }

    .blog-detail-cta__content > p {
      margin-top: 20px;
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 25.2px;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .blog-detail *,
    .blog-detail *::before,
    .blog-detail *::after {
      scroll-behavior: auto !important;
      transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;
      animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;
    }
  }
</style>
